{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Selene 是一款為輪班及不定時工作人士而設的排班日曆，原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。程式沒有廣告，亦毋須註冊帳戶，30 款插畫風格主題全部提供，並以經典版面呈現。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-113.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>輪班鬧鐘自動配合班次</h2>\n<p>可為每種班次設定鬧鐘，鬧鐘隨更表自動編排，毋須逐次手動調整（需 iOS 26 或以上）。主畫面小工具讓你毋須開啟 App 亦可查看即將到來的班次；加入多個日曆即可對比同事或家人的更表。排班可匯出成 PDF、圖片或多人 CSV，同步至系統日曆，並配合備註與換班記錄使用。內置 30 款主題，全部支援深色模式與 iCloud 同步。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-229-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-230-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-231-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-377-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-233-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-234-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Selene: Shift Calendar</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/selene-shift-calendar/id1410053842?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:29.472151+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T00:51:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:08.582568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:58:44.654018+00:00","content_hash":"bb5d1fd01caf6270ca3340e5b744121d0f3bef2cf07cb147bdd2915c65f17d40","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:29.472151+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}